  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">TECHNICAL AUDIT CONSULTANT FOR THE KARIBA DAM REHABILITATION PROJECT &#xbf; RESHAPING OF THE PLUNGE POOL</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The contract is for the provision of services to carry out regular technical audits of the rehabilitation of the Kariba Dam for the scope of works covering the reshaping of the plunge pool and the treatment of the soft rocks area (EU funded component of the project).The purpose is to provide factual reporting and advice with regard to the organisational, technical, contractual and financial aspects of the project and the results achieved during its implementation.</narrative>
  </description>
